@*
    SAT Math reference sheet (formulas provided on the real test), written for
    SatPrep and rendered with the bundled KaTeX.
*@
@{
    // Markdown with LaTeX; rendered server-side to \( \) spans
    const string sheet = @"
| Shape | Formula |
|---|---|
| Circle | $A = \pi r^2$, $C = 2\pi r$ |
| Rectangle | $A = \ell w$ |
| Triangle | $A = \frac{1}{2}bh$ |
| Right triangle | $c^2 = a^2 + b^2$ |
| Special right triangles | $x,\ x\sqrt{3},\ 2x$ (30°-60°-90°) and $s,\ s,\ s\sqrt{2}$ (45°-45°-90°) |
| Rectangular prism | $V = \ell w h$ |
| Cylinder | $V = \pi r^2 h$ |
| Sphere | $V = \frac{4}{3}\pi r^3$ |
| Cone | $V = \frac{1}{3}\pi r^2 h$ |
| Pyramid | $V = \frac{1}{3}\ell w h$ |

- The number of degrees of arc in a circle is 360.
- The number of radians of arc in a circle is $2\pi$.
- The sum of the measures in degrees of the angles of a triangle is 180.
";
}
<div class="modal fade" id="refModal" tabindex="-1">
    <div class="modal-dialog modal-lg modal-dialog-scrollable">
        <div class="modal-content">
            <div class="modal-header">
                <h2 class="modal-title h5">Reference sheet</h2>
                <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal"></button>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body lesson refsheet" id="refBody">
                @Html.Raw(Md.Render(sheet))
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
